               <code>
                  <coding>
                     <system value="http://loinc.org"/>
                     <code value="8648-8"/>
                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your 85-year-old female patient, admitted on 06/11/2020 with confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection presenting as COVID-19 pneumonia. On admission, she was febrile, hypoxic with oxygen saturation of 84% on room air, and in moderate respiratory distress. Chest X-ray and CT thorax confirmed bilateral infiltrates consistent with viral pneumonia. Blood tests revealed elevated inflammatory markers including CRP and D-dimer. She received supplemental oxygen therapy, antiviral treatment with remdesivir, dexamethasone, prophylactic anticoagulation, and supportive intravenous fluids. Pulse oximetry was monitored continuously. She was mobilised with physiotherapy support. Clinical condition gradually improved and she was discharged on 17/11/2020 in recovering condition with home oxygen. Please continue monitoring oxygen saturation, inflammatory parameters, and functional recovery. Follow-up appointment in two weeks is recommended. Yours sincerely, Dr. [Hospital Physician]</div>
               </text>
